---
const whatsapp = 'https://wa.me/5491166666666?text=Hola%20Tori%20Log%C3%ADstica%2C%20necesito%20informaci%C3%B3n';
---
<section class="bg-white py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center px-4">
    <div>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">Envíos Turbo/Flex para tu negocio</h1>
      <p class="mb-6 text-gray-700">Somos especialistas en logística para MercadoLibre en CABA y alrededores.</p>
      <a href={whatsapp} class="rounded-full bg-brand px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:brightness-110">Contactar</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
      <img src="/assets/hero-moto.webp" alt="Repartidor en moto" class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl shadow" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
